[36m(TaskRunner pid=140613)[0m ### Step 2: Convert the numbers from base $ b $ to base 10
[36m(TaskRunner pid=140613)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=140613)[0m Recall:  
[36m(TaskRunner pid=140613)[0m - $ 17_b = 1 \cdot b + 7 = b + 7 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=140613)[0m - $ 97_b = 9 \cdot b + 7 = 9b + 7 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=140613)[0m 
