[36m(TaskRunner pid=140613)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=140613)[0m ### Step 3: Use the divisibility condition
[36m(TaskRunner pid=140613)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=140613)[0m Let $ d = b + 7 $, so we want $ d \mid 9b + 7 $. Since $ d = b + 7 $, we can write:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=140613)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=140613)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=140613)[0m b = d - 7
[36m(TaskRunner pid=140613)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=140613)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=140613)[0m Now substitute into $ 9b + 7 $:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=140613)[0m 
